    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Starships_of_the_Galaxy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Starships of the Galaxy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Starships of the Galaxy</a></i></p><p><b>Emplacement Points:</b>&nbsp;1</p><p><b>Size Restriction:</b>&nbsp;Colossal or Larger</p><p>A Droid Repair Team automatically deploys to repair a Starship when it moves -1 or more steps down the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a>- no action on the part of the crew is necessary to activate it. A Droid Repair Team does not take any action other than to make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a> check to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Jury-Rig\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Jury-Rig\">Jury-Rig</a> a Starship, moving it +1 step on the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a>. A Droid Repair Team has a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a> check modifier of +13.</p><p>If a Starship takes damage that exceeds it's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Shield_Rating\" title=\"Shield Rating\">Shield Rating</a> (if any) in a round when a Droid Repair Team is active, there's a 25% chance that the Droid Repair Team is destroyed.</p>",
